.TH INFINITIME-BUILDER 1 "" "InfiniTime Builder" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
infinitime-builder \- choose apps and watch faces for the PineTime and build InfiniTime firmware
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B infinitime-builder
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B infinitime-builder
opens a window in which you switch InfiniTime's apps and watch faces on or off, set their order in
the launcher, add third-party apps and watch faces from GitHub repositories or local folders, and
build a firmware update (\fIpinetime-mcuboot-app-dfu-*.zip\fR) to install on the watch with a
companion app such as Gadgetbridge, InfiniLink, Siglo, ITD or Amazfish.
.PP
Firmware is compiled in the official InfiniTime build container, with Podman or Docker. The first
build downloads the InfiniTime source and the build image.
.PP
For headless builds and for checking app manifests, see
.BR infinitime-builder-cli (1).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B GITHUB_TOKEN\fR, \fBGH_TOKEN
A GitHub token, for private package repositories and a higher API rate limit. It is only sent to
api.github.com.
.TP
.B INFINITIME_BUILDER_HOME
Directory for settings and caches, instead of the default below.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/infinitime-builder/
Settings (\fIsettings.json\fR), downloaded sources and build trees (follows \fBXDG_DATA_HOME\fR).
.TP
.I ~/InfiniTime Builds/
Built firmware, unless another output folder is chosen.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR infinitime-builder-cli (1),
.BR podman (1)
.PP
https://github.com/ScanuNicco/infinitime-builder
